<title>USA: Sharpe Resources gets 4 blocks in Gulf.</title>
<headline>Sharpe Resources gets 4 blocks in Gulf.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sharpe Resources Corp said on Tuesday that its subsidiary Sharpe Energy Co bid successfully on four offshore blocks in the Gulf of Mexico off Matagorda County, Texas.</p>
<p>The blocks totaling 1,760 acres adjoin properties acquired by Sharpe in February and could double the company's above-7,000-foot-depth natural gas reserves in the area, Sharpe said.</p>
</text>
